        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-md">
          <p class="text-base font-semibold text-[#02275A]">Artis &amp; Dorothy Croslin</p>
